blocks.text:
POST /files/upload-session          {path, size, block_hashes[]} -> {missing_hashes[], session_id}
PUT  /blocks/{hash}                 body = block bytes (presigned URL to the block store)
POST /files/commit                  {session_id, path, block_hashes[], parent_rev} -> {rev}
GET  /files/list_folder/continue    {cursor} -> {entries[], cursor, has_more}
GET  /files/longpoll                {cursor} -> {changes: bool}   (held open ~60 s)
GET  /files/download                {path, rev} -> block_hashes[] + presigned block URLs
